11. Teenage love and such offences fall in a legal grey area and it is debatable if that can be actually categorized as an offence.
This Court at the moment is not commenting as to whether the offence has been committed by the Petitioner or not.
This Court at the moment is only considering that the Petitioner, who at the time of incident was about 20 years of age and, as of today, he is 22 years of age, should be further kept in custody or not.
